      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This unusual synchronization could potentially indicate an interference issue between your smart devices. It's possible that the process of detecting voice commands or wireless activity from your phone is causing momentary electromagnetic interference that affects both the lights and the thermostat. You might want to check the placement of your Wi-Fi router or other electronics, as physical proximity can sometimes cause cross-device crosstalk.",
