      "content": "If you strongly suspect a targeted monitoring mechanism, the most secure immediate precaution is to completely isolate these devices from the internet by disabling their Wi-Fi connections. You can also consider implementing a \"Faraday cage\" effect by placing them in a room shielded from outside radio frequencies, though this is extreme. For practical steps, look into network-level monitoring tools to check for anomalous outgoing data traffic associated with those specific devices.",
